---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title="Jeremy Hoover | Product, Design, and AI Systems">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero__grid">
        <div class="hero__content">
          <p class="hero__eyebrow">Product strategy · Design systems · AI workflows</p>
          <h1 class="hero__name">Hi, I’m Jeremy. <span>I design systems people love to use.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero__pitch">
            My career spans journalism, marketing, UX, accessibility, developer tools, and AI products. Today I design customer-facing tools, content experiences, and AI workflows that connect design, product, and engineering.
          </p>
          <div class="hero__actions">
            <a href="#projects" class="btn">Explore selected projects</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--outline hero__contact">Get in touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <span class="hero-art__shape hero-art__shape--yellow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="hero-art__shape hero-art__shape--coral" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="hero-art__portrait">
            <img src={`${base}/images/jeremy-hoover.jpg`} alt="Jeremy Hoover" width="460" height="460" />
          </div>
          <div class="hero__affiliations" aria-label="Current affiliations">
            <a class="affiliation affiliation--microsoft" href="https://www.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="microsoft-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span>Microsoft</span>
            </a>
            <a class="affiliation affiliation--uxcc" href="https://uxcontent.com/technical-content-designer-program/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <img src="https://uxcontent.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/cropped-UXCC-THUMB-circle-192x192.png" alt="UX Content Collective" width="192" height="192" />
              <span class="affiliation__label">UX Content Collective</span>
              <span class="sr-only">Instructor at UX Content Collective</span>
            </a>
            <a class="affiliation affiliation--reichman" href="https://www.runi.ac.il/en/schools/rris/graduate/ma-human-computer-interaction" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <img src="https://www.runi.ac.il/media/hbvhwh5g/brand-en.png?format=webp" alt="Reichman University" width="230" height="74" />
              <span class="sr-only">MA HCI student at Reichman University</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SELECTED PROJECTS -->
  <section class="projects" id="projects">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Selected projects</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="projects__grid">

        <a href={`${base}/work/ai-design-repo`} class="project project--blue">
          <div class="project__visual project__visual--image">
            <img src={`${base}/images/case-studies/ai-design-repo.webp`} alt="AI design automation system connecting skills, agents, context, brand guidance, and a component library to a generated design" width="1261" height="1247" />
          </div>
          <div class="project__body">
            <h3>Building the repository our teams use to design with AI</h3>
            <p>I identified a fragmented prototyping problem and built the shared repository that became a required workflow for dozens of designers, product managers, and engineers across multiple teams.</p>
            <span class="project__link">Read case study &#8594;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/work/hackathon`} class="project project--violet">
          <div class="project__visual project__visual--image">
            <img src={`${base}/images/case-studies/hackathon-agent.webp`} alt="AI agent transforming a product requirements document into verified reports and structured work items" width="1254" height="1254" />
          </div>
          <div class="project__body">
            <h3>Replacing a requirements maze with a verified agent workflow</h3>
            <p>I designed a PRD-first skill that replaced repeated wiki search, form completion, routing, and manual work setup. Our three-person team won Best Use of AI, and the proof of concept became a catalyst for evolving PM skills and agents.</p>
            <span class="project__link">Read case study &#8594;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/work/org-ai-initiatives`} class="project project--orange">
          <div class="project__visual project__visual--image">
            <img src={`${base}/images/case-studies/org-ai-initiatives.webp`} alt="AI infrastructure connecting an initiated agent with designers, knowledge, component libraries, workflows, governance, and AI tools" width="1254" height="1254" />
          </div>
          <div class="project__body">
            <h3>Building the conditions for AI adoption across the design org</h3>
            <p>I identified three gaps in how the org was approaching AI, drove each from idea to required workflow, and trained designers and managers to use them. The work spans a content-design agent, a knowledge base, and org-wide training that is now part of how the organization works.</p>
            <span class="project__link">Read case study &#8594;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/work/fabric-cli`} class="project project--green">
          <div class="project__visual project__visual--image">
            <img src={`${base}/images/case-studies/fabric-cli.webp`} alt="Fabric CLI AI skills moving through validation, commit, verification, packaging, production, and rollout" width="1254" height="1254" />
          </div>
          <div class="project__body">
            <h3>Designing the AI execution layer for Fabric CLI</h3>
            <p>I identified a missing product layer, shaped the direction with the product manager, and implemented the public AI assets shipped with Fabric CLI at GA. The work is verifiable through public PRs, release notes, and a co-authored launch article.</p>
            <span class="project__link">Read case study &#8594;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RECENT EXPERIENCE -->
  <section class="experience" id="experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recent experience</h2>
        <a href={`${base}/about`} class="section-header__link">Full background &#8594;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="exp__list">

        <div class="exp__item">
          <div class="exp__left">
            <p class="exp__company">Microsoft</p>
            <p class="exp__period">2022 to present</p>
          </div>
          <div class="exp__right">
            <p class="exp__title">Senior Content Designer, AI systems and developer experiences</p>
            <p class="exp__desc">Designing content and product experiences for Microsoft Fabric CI/CD, CLI, and MCP tools. Building AI workflows and evaluation frameworks, owning the team design automation repo, and contributing across org-wide AI initiatives.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exp__item">
          <div class="exp__left">
            <p class="exp__company">UX Content Collective</p>
            <p class="exp__period">2026 to present</p>
          </div>
          <div class="exp__right">
            <p class="exp__title">Creator and instructor, Technical Content Designer Program</p>
            <p class="exp__desc">Created and lead a program that gives content designers hands-on experience with developer tools and AI systems.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exp__item">
          <div class="exp__left">
            <p class="exp__company">Wix.com</p>
            <p class="exp__period">2018 to 2022</p>
          </div>
          <div class="exp__right">
            <p class="exp__title">Senior UX Writer · Accessibility Champion</p>
            <p class="exp__desc">Lead UX writer for Wix Code. Content strategy, usability testing, A/B testing, localization across 15+ languages. Accessibility champion across the org. Hackathon winner.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TECHNICAL CONTENT DESIGNER PROGRAM -->
  <section class="program" id="program">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="program__content">
        <p class="program__eyebrow">Creator and instructor</p>
        <h2>Technical Content Designer Program</h2>
        <p>I created and teach this program with the UX Content Collective. It gives content designers, product designers, and design managers practical fluency with repositories, Git, GitHub, VS Code, the terminal, and AI tools. Participants learn to work confidently with engineers, contribute directly to product development, and apply AI responsibly in real production workflows.</p>
        <a href="https://uxcontent.com/technical-content-designer-program/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--outline">Explore the program &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="program__curriculum" aria-label="Program curriculum">
        <span><small>01</small><strong>Build technical confidence</strong></span>
        <span><small>02</small><strong>Collaborate with engineers</strong></span>
        <span><small>03</small><strong>Contribute to product development</strong></span>
        <span><small>04</small><strong>Use AI responsibly in production</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOOVER CONTENT SYSTEM -->
  <section class="hcs" id="open-source">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hcs__panel">
        <div class="hcs__content">
          <p class="hcs__eyebrow">Independent open-source work</p>
          <h2>Hoover Content System</h2>
          <p>A living content system for developer products. I built it to move content guidance out of static documents and into a structured, version-controlled system teams can maintain, extend, and use in their daily work.</p>
          <a href="https://jeremydhoover-blip.github.io/hoover-content-system/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hcs__link">Explore the live system &#8599;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hcs__visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="hcs-window">
            <div class="hcs-window__bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="hcs-window__body">
              <div class="hcs-window__nav">
                <span>Principles</span><span>Patterns</span><span>Components</span><span>Accessibility</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hcs-window__doc">
                <strong>Content pattern</strong>
                <span></span><span></span><span class="short"></span>
                <div class="hcs-window__code">version: 1.0.0</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PUBLISHED ARTICLES -->
  <section class="writing" id="writing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Published articles</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="writing__intro">Ideas and practical frameworks across AI systems, technical content design, product measurement, and no-code tools.</p>
      <div class="writing__cols">

        <div class="writing__group">
          <div class="writing__group-head"><p class="writing__src">LinkedIn</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/my-personal-evolution-creating-agentic-skills-jeremy-hoover-nhckf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>My Personal Evolution: Creating Agentic Skills</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/how-ai-changing-way-i-work-content-designer-jeremy-hoover-qz4gf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>How AI Is Changing the Way I Work</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/missing-link-ai-your-web-knowledge-jeremy-hoover-29kvf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>The Missing Link: AI and Your Web Knowledge</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/beyond-style-guides-build-living-content-system-developer-hoover-efhtf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Beyond Style Guides: Build a Living Content System</span></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="writing__group">
          <div class="writing__group-head"><p class="writing__src">UX Content Collective</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://uxcontent.com/essential-ai-concepts-for-content-designers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Essential AI Concepts for Content Designers</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://uxcontent.com/technical-content-design/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Technical Content Design</span></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="writing__group">
          <div class="writing__group-head"><p class="writing__src">Contributor credits</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.smashingmagazine.com/2020/07/renaissance-no-code-web-designers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>The Renaissance of No-Code for Web Designers</span><em>Smashing Magazine</em></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://uxdesign.cc/kpi-is-the-most-important-tool-ux-designers-should-be-learning-to-use-af31651120fc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>KPI Is an Imperative Tool for UX Designers</span><em>UX Collective</em></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EDUCATION + RECOGNITION -->
  <section class="credentials" id="education">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-header credentials__header">
        <h2>Education and recognition</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cred__grid">

        <div class="cred__block cred__block--education">
          <div class="cred__title"><h3>Education</h3></div>
          <ul class="cred__list">
            <li>
              <strong>Reichman University</strong>
              <span>MA, Human-Computer Interaction · 2026 to 2027</span>
              <em>Merit scholarship recipient</em>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Metropolitan State University of Denver</strong>
              <span>BA, History · Minor in Journalism · 2006 to 2011</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="cred__block cred__block--recognition">
          <div class="cred__title"><h3>Recognition</h3></div>
          <ul class="cred__list">
            <li>
              <strong>Hackathon winner · Microsoft</strong>
              <span>Best Use of AI</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Hackathon winner · Wix.com</strong>
              <span>Accessibility</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Helen Verba Award</strong>
              <span>Society of Professional Journalists, Metropolitan State University of Denver</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Top of the Rockies Contest</strong>
              <span>Online law and order feature writing; health investigative and enterprise reporting</span>
              <em>Two First Place awards</em>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="contact__inner">
        <div>
          <h2>Let's talk</h2>
          <p>Have a question about product strategy, design systems, technical content design, or AI workflows?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact__cta">
          <a href="mailto:jeremyd.hoover@gmail.com" class="btn btn--outline">Email me</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jeremydhoover/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--outline">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  :global(:root) {
    --portfolio-blue: #1155cc;
    --portfolio-blue-soft: #dfe9ff;
    --portfolio-yellow: #f6d365;
    --portfolio-coral: #ff7657;
    --portfolio-cream: #f4efe5;
    --portfolio-ink: #101a2d;
    --portfolio-radius: 24px;
  }

  /* ─ HERO ─ */
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    background: var(--portfolio-blue);
    color: #fff;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(340px, 0.9fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: end;
  }
  .hero__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--portfolio-yellow);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .hero__name {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 20ch;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.3vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .hero__name span { display: block; color: var(--portfolio-blue-soft); }
  .hero__pitch {
    font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .hero__affiliations {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    width: min(82%, 390px);
    height: 60px;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--portfolio-blue), var(--portfolio-blue)) padding-box,
      linear-gradient(115deg, var(--portfolio-blue-soft) 0%, var(--portfolio-yellow) 52%, var(--portfolio-coral) 100%) border-box;
  }
  .affiliation {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    min-width: 0;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(244,239,229,0.38);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .affiliation:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .affiliation:hover { text-decoration: none; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .affiliation img { display: block; width: auto; max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  .affiliation--uxcc img { width: 38px; }
  .affiliation--reichman img { width: 64px; }
  .affiliation__label { max-width: 5.5rem; color: #fff; font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; }
  .microsoft-mark { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 7px); gap: 1px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .microsoft-mark i { width: 7px; height: 7px; }
  .microsoft-mark i:nth-child(1) { background: #f35325; }
  .microsoft-mark i:nth-child(2) { background: #81bc06; }
  .microsoft-mark i:nth-child(3) { background: #05a6f0; }
  .microsoft-mark i:nth-child(4) { background: #ffba08; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero__affiliations { width: 78%; }
    .affiliation { padding-inline: 0.35rem; }
    .affiliation__label { display: none; }
  }
  .hero__actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 230px));
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    width: auto;
  }
  .hero .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--portfolio-yellow);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--portfolio-yellow);
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .hero .btn:hover { background: rgba(246,211,101,0.12); border-color: #ffe28a; color: #ffe28a; text-decoration: none; }
  .hero .hero__contact { color: #fff; border-color: var(--portfolio-coral); }
  .hero .hero__contact:hover { background: rgba(255,118,87,0.14); border-color: #ff9b83; color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero__actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; width: 100%; }
    .hero .btn { width: 100%; white-space: normal; }
  }
  .hero-art {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr auto;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 520px;
  }
  .hero-art__portrait {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: min(82%, 390px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 10px solid var(--portfolio-cream);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(4,31,86,0.28);
  }
  .hero-art img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 30%;
    filter: saturate(0.92) contrast(1.03);
  }
  .hero-art .affiliation--uxcc img { width: 38px; height: 38px; object-fit: contain; filter: none; }
  .hero-art .affiliation--reichman img { width: 64px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; filter: none; }
  .hero-art__shape { position: absolute; display: block; }
  .hero-art__shape--yellow {
    width: 46%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    top: 2%;
    right: 1%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--portfolio-yellow);
  }
  .hero-art__shape--coral {
    width: 42%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    bottom: 4.75rem;
    left: 2%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--portfolio-coral);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: center; }
    .hero-art { width: min(100%, 560px); min-height: 470px; margin-inline: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-art { min-height: 390px; }
    .hero-art__portrait { width: 78%; border-width: 7px; }
  }

  /* ─ SECTION HEADER ─ */
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .section-header__link {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .section-header__link:hover { color: var(--text); }

  /* ─ PROJECTS ─ */
  .projects { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); background: #fff; }
  .projects__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .project {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--portfolio-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    background: #fff;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }
  .project:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(21, 26, 35, 0.11);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .project__visual {
    min-height: 210px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .project__visual--image { padding: 0; }
  .project__visual--image img {
    display: block;
    width: min(100%, 300px);
    height: 300px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .project--blue .project__visual--image,
  .project--violet .project__visual--image { background: var(--portfolio-blue); }
  .project--orange .project__visual--image { background: var(--portfolio-coral); }
  .project--green .project__visual--image { background: var(--portfolio-blue-soft); }
  .project--blue .project__visual { background: var(--portfolio-blue); }
  .project--violet .project__visual { background: var(--portfolio-yellow); }
  .project--orange .project__visual { background: var(--portfolio-coral); }
  .project--green .project__visual { background: var(--portfolio-blue-soft); }
  .project__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .project__body h3 { font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); }
  .project__body p { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  .project__link {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .project:hover .project__link { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .projects__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* ─ EXPERIENCE ─ */
  .experience {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    background: var(--portfolio-yellow);
